@startuml
title Flujo 2 · Añadir un claim (ERC-735)

actor Issuer as Iss
participant "Claims\n(ERC-735)" as CL
participant "Identity\n(ERC-725)" as ID

note over Iss
Precondición:
Issuer firma payload canónico:
keccak256(topic, subject, hash(data))
end note

Iss -> CL : addClaim(topic, issuer, signature,\n data, uri) sobre subject = ID
CL -> CL : Verifica firma (issuer == recover(signature,payload))
CL -> CL : Registra claim (almacén interno)
CL -> Iss : Éxito
CL -> CL : Emitir evento ClaimAdded(topic, issuer, id)
@enduml
